      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹4.18 (vs ₹4.64 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.18 (down from ₹4.64 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹6.80b (up 4.1% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.33b (down 9.9% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 20% (down from 23% in 3Q 2025). Revenue is forecast to grow 20% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 5.7% growth forecast for the Oil and Gas industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 10% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 58% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
